    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061125.0038\n\nDAR ES SALAAM, Nov. 25 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nTanzania ready for Anoca Games\n\n\n\n\nTanzania has confirmed participation in the forthcoming Association of National Olympic Committees of Africa (Anoca) Zone Five U-20 Games.\n\nTanzania has thus joined Burundi, Egypt, Ethiopia, Eritrea, Kenya, Rwanda, Somalia, Sudan and Uganda in the Games to be held in Nairobi of Kenya between Dec. 1 and 5.\n\nThe Anoca Games will feature four sports of track and field, boxing, cycling and basketball.",
